# The wheel carries only the importable package; the source distribution also
# carries the material a reader needs to reproduce the figures: the example
# generators, the written guides, and the changelog. Generated figures and the
# LaTeX showcase stay out -- they are large, and the repository holds them.
include CHANGELOG.md
include requirements.txt
recursive-include examples *.py *.md
recursive-include docs *.md
prune docs/figures
prune docs/dev
